    "en": {
      "title": "VibroDrill",
      "h1": "VibroDrill",
      "description": "VibroDrill is a drilling system that combines rotation with controlled vibration to drive the drill efficiently through difficult soil layers. It is used for…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "VibroDrill",
          "width": 549,
          "height": 500,
          "src": "/assets/img/terra-infrastructure-vibrodrill-1.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "VibroDrill is a drilling system that combines rotation with controlled vibration to drive the drill efficiently through difficult soil layers. It is used for foundation work and geotechnical works such as micropiles, self-drilling anchors and geothermal drilling. The vibration helps reduce resistance in the ground and gives a smoother drilling process with better control."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Feel free to take a look at the brochure below or <a href=\"/contacto\">contact us</a> for more information."
